OL,3,GNEWSAMayor rejects business class for
OL,4,AIndia trip - but can see the benefits
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Mayor of West Yorkshire says she
OL,7,Fwill not be flying business class when
OL,8,Fshe goes to India later this month on a
OL,9,Ftrade mission.
OL,11,FLabour's Tracy Brabin has been
OL,12,Fanswering questions on Message the
OL,13,FMayor on BBC Radio Leeds.
OL,15,FShe has also been talking about the
OL,16,Fearly release of prisoners, the new
OL,17,Fbuses being built for West Yorkshire
OL,18,Fand increasing investment in the area.
OL,20,FRead our takeaways from the interview
OL,21,Fbelow or listen to the full interview
OL,22,Fhere.
